!==============================================================================
!                                                                             !
!  NCL      Number of color levels  not including the background, foreground, !
!             land, water, and overlays colors.                               !
!                                                                             !
!  IPAL     Color value specification:                                        !
!                                                                             !
!             If IPAL=1, only the (iR,iG,iB) values are considered by the     !
!             application program (other values are read as dummy variables). !
!             The iR, iG, and iB values represent the red, green, and blue    !
!             contributions (an integer value ranging from 0 to 255).         !
!                                                                             !
!             If IPAL=2, only the (R,G,B) values are considered by the        !
!             application program (other values are read as dummy variables). !
!             The R, G, and B values represent the red, green, and blue       !
!             contributions (a real value ranging from 0.0 to 1.0).           !
!                                                                             !
!  IBARLAB  Labeling interval for color bands in the color bar. If            !
!             IBARLAB=1, all color bands will be labeled.                     !
!                                                                             !
!  NOTICE:  The first color record is that for the background whereas the     !
!  ------   second is that for the foreground.  The last the color are        !
!           respectively for land, water, and polyline overlays (contour      !
!           or vectors).                                                      !
!                                                                             !
!==============================================================================
!
